
curl -v -c p.txt localhost:8080/cgi_bin/

-c p.txt (--cookie-jar p.txt)

Saves any cookies the server sends (Set-Cookie headers) into p.txt.
Does not send any cookies from p.txt with the request.



curl -v -b p.txt -c p.txt localhost:8080/cgi_bin/


-b p.txt (--cookie p.txt)
Reads cookies from p.txt and sends them with the request.
-c p.txt
Updates p.txt with any new or modified cookies received from the server.






